credentials**

# Anchored to the app root, deliberately. Unanchored `android**` / `ios**` match
# at any depth, which also swallowed modules/*/android and modules/*/ios and
# silently kept the hardware-key native sources out of the repo entirely.
/android/
/ios/

private**
.env.local
